<view class="navbar" style="height: {{statusBarHeight + navBarHeight}}px;">
  <view style="height: {{statusBarHeight}}px;"></view>
  <view class="navbar-content" style="height: {{navBarHeight}}px;">
    <view class="navbar-back" bindtap="onBack">
      <svg-icon name="back" size="18px" />
    </view>
    <text class="navbar-title">使用攻略</text>
  </view>
</view>
<view style="height: {{statusBarHeight + navBarHeight}}px;"></view>

<view class="page-body">
  <view class="hero">
    <text class="hero-title">只提醒，不代抢不代约</text>
    <text class="hero-sub">设好提醒后，到点去官方渠道抢票即可。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="guide-card">
    <view class="section-head">
      <view class="section-index">1</view>
      <view>
        <text class="section-title">两种设置提醒方式</text>
        <text class="section-sub">按你的习惯选择，提交后才会创建提醒</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="mode-list">
      <view class="mode-item">
        <view class="mode-head">
          <text class="mode-tag">主流程</text>
          <text class="mode-title">先排行程，再批量提醒</text>
        </view>
        <text class="mode-desc">选择日期和景点，生成时间线并加入清单后，一次检查授权与提醒名额。</text>
        <text class="mode-steps">选日期 → 选景点 → 提交提醒</text>
      </view>
      <view class="mode-item">
        <view class="mode-head">
          <text class="mode-tag secondary">景点页</text>
          <text class="mode-title">为单个景点直接设提醒</text>
        </view>
        <text class="mode-desc">在景点页选中一个景点和出行日期，点“设提醒”，再完成同一套授权检查。</text>
        <text class="mode-steps">进景点页 → 选日期 → 设提醒</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="sample-entry" bindtap="onReminderSamples">
      <text>查看提醒样式示例</text>
      <svg-icon name="chevron-right" size="12px" />
    </view>
    <view class="action-row">
      <view class="card-action" bindtap="onAddTrip">先新增行程</view>
      <view class="card-action secondary" bindtap="onSpots">去景点页</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="guide-card">
    <view class="section-head">
      <view class="section-index">2</view>
      <view>
        <text class="section-title">没收到提醒怎么办</text>
        <text class="section-sub">先检查两个授权，再看行程卡状态</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="tip-list">
      <text>· 微信系统通知未开启，订阅消息也无法正常送达。</text>
      <text>· 微信订阅消息按条授权，提交前要确认本次额度足够。</text>
      <text>· 放票时间过后仍未送达，行程卡会显示“未送达”，可点开查看原因。</text>
    </view>
    <view class="card-action secondary" bindtap="onNotifySettings">打开提醒设置</view>
  </view>

  <view class="guide-card">
    <view class="section-head">
      <view class="section-index">3</view>
      <view>
        <text class="section-title">去官方渠道前</text>
        <text class="section-sub">我们只提醒，不代填、不代抢</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="tip-list">
      <text>· 若官方渠道支持常用联系人，可提前录入游客姓名和证件信息。</text>
      <text>· 只使用景点官方小程序、公众号或官网，不向第三方代抢渠道提供证件。</text>
      <text>· 闭馆日、放票时间和证件要求以景点页及官方当日公告为准。</text>
    </view>
    <view class="action-row">
      <view class="card-action" bindtap="onSpots">查看景点规则</view>
      <view class="card-action secondary" bindtap="onCorrection">信息纠错</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="faq-section">
    <view class="faq-section-head">
      <text class="faq-title">常见问题</text>
      <text class="faq-section-sub">支付与退款问题集中在下方</text>
    </view>
    <text class="faq-group-title">预约与提醒</text>
    <view
      wx:for="{{reminderFaqs}}"
      wx:key="key"
      class="faq-item {{openFaq === item.key ? 'open' : ''}}"
      bindtap="onToggleFaq"
      data-key="{{item.key}}"
    >
      <view class="faq-question">
        <text>{{item.q}}</text>
        <svg-icon name="{{openFaq === item.key ? 'chevron-up' : 'chevron-down'}}" size="14px" />
      </view>
      <text wx:if="{{openFaq === item.key}}" class="faq-answer">{{item.a}}</text>
    </view>

    <view id="payment-faq" class="payment-faq-group">
      <view class="payment-faq-head">
        <view>
          <text class="faq-group-title">会员与支付</text>
          <text class="payment-faq-sub">到账、退款与 Apple 订单</text>
        </view>
        <text class="payment-faq-count">{{paymentFaqs.length}} 个问题</text>
      </view>
      <view
        wx:for="{{paymentFaqs}}"
        wx:key="key"
        class="faq-item {{openFaq === item.key ? 'open' : ''}}"
        bindtap="onToggleFaq"
        data-key="{{item.key}}"
      >
        <view class="faq-question">
          <text>{{item.q}}</text>
          <svg-icon name="{{openFaq === item.key ? 'chevron-up' : 'chevron-down'}}" size="14px" />
        </view>
        <text wx:if="{{openFaq === item.key}}" class="faq-answer">{{item.a}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <text class="guide-disclaimer">抢票操作请以官方渠道页面为准。本工具不代抢、不代约，也不保证抢票成功。</text>
</view>

<reminder-sample-sheet show="{{showSampleSheet}}" bind:close="onCloseReminderSamples" />
